<title>SWEDEN: Swedish 10-yr bond auction sees 7.02 pct avg yld.</title>
<headline>Swedish 10-yr bond auction sees 7.02 pct avg yld.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted yield on an auction of 2.0 billion crowns of 10-year bonds was 7.02 percent, the National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>					    Loan 1038</p>
<p> Volume issued (millions)		 2,000</p>
<p> Total bids    (millions)		 6,555</p>
<p> Number of accepted bids			5</p>
<p> Number of bids				  69</p>
<p> Lowest yields  (pct)		     7.010</p>
<p> Highest yields			     7.030</p>
<p> Weighted average yield		   7.021</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
